  <!-- Ambient background sound loading message block -->
  <div id="soundLoadAlert" class="absolute bottom-16 right-6 max-w-xs aero-glass rounded-xl p-3 text-white text-[11px] z-50 shadow-md transition-all duration-500 translate-y-20 opacity-0 pointer-events-none">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-exclamation text-amber-300 text-sm"></i>
      <span>オーディオが正常に有効化されました。美しい環境合成音をお楽しみください。</span>
